[{"title":"桃源词二首 其一","author":"释函可","text":"当年鬼哭便应焚，灰冷难招坑底魂。\n先世为儒知不免，桃花那得到儿孙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46385,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"桃源词二首 其二","author":"释函可","text":"鸡犬寻常得自由，从来无喜亦无忧。\n眼中若见秦时代，满洞花开也是愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46386,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入山杂咏二十首 其一","author":"释函可","text":"曲曲溪流去复回，山花夹路石门开。\n老僧望见频挥手，莫带红尘一点来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46387,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入山杂咏二十首 其二","author":"释函可","text":"竹杖随身任我移，袈裟搭在矮松枝。\n青山处处容吾住，欲著茆檐便不宜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46388,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入山杂咏二十首 其三","author":"释函可","text":"居山元是此山人，似我山居日日新。\n莫笑浮生无定止，但逢好石足乡邻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46389,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入山杂咏二十首 其四","author":"释函可","text":"莫问西来路不同，何妨麋鹿得相从。\n山山到处看俱好，最爱溪南第四峰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46390,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入山杂咏二十首 其五","author":"释函可","text":"横路枯松挂古藤，几年踏雪到来曾。\n偶看虎迹间人迹，知是长眉赤脚僧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46391,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入山杂咏二十首 其六","author":"释函可","text":"一饱欣欣乐有馀，主人犹我我犹渠。\n翻思二十年前事，翠幕华堂是客居。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46392,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入山杂咏二十首 其七","author":"释函可","text":"老大无家亦有筇，寻山山顶有高松。\n芒鞋常恐行来遍，一日排云到一峰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46393,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入山杂咏二十首 其八","author":"释函可","text":"杖头到处是吾家，瓶钵都将挂树桠。\n趺坐偶然盘石上，不须山鸟更衔花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46394,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入山杂咏二十首 其九","author":"释函可","text":"已过溪云几十重，忽闻林外一声钟。\n欲寻人处无人问，满地纵横是虎踪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46395,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入山杂咏二十首 其十","author":"释函可","text":"一宿僧堂即便行，主人留客客无情。\n磬声只到山门止，一路猿啼共鸟鸣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46396,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入山杂咏二十首 其十一","author":"释函可","text":"山花历乱杂蒿莱，一度来寻一度开。\n猿狖不曾离旧处，笑予频去又频回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46397,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入山杂咏二十首 其十二","author":"释函可","text":"一双草履一边瓢，一卷残书伴寂寥。\n莫道无枝枝未稳，从今更不羡鹪鹩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46398,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入山杂咏二十首 其十三","author":"释函可","text":"何处非吾得志时，山麋野雀共嬉嬉。\n独行率意还同阮，但到穷途泪不垂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46399,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入山杂咏二十首 其十四","author":"释函可","text":"半掩柴关一径苔，山梨几树落堆堆。\n老僧定起开眸看，疑是山猿拾果来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46400,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入山杂咏二十首 其十五","author":"释函可","text":"垂垂白发坐凄凄，尽日空山听鸟啼。\n笑指岩松高百尺，入山时节与肩齐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46401,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入山杂咏二十首 其十六","author":"释函可","text":"千峰寂寂待知音，人世纷纭那许寻。\n不是我来频寄迹，孤他泉壑万年心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46402,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入山杂咏二十首 其十七","author":"释函可","text":"市迹才通便不清，深藏塞外不知名。\n中原无限佳山水，杂沓人来亦世情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46403,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入山杂咏二十首 其十八","author":"释函可","text":"无如此地足幽栖，满眼苍青我亦迷。\n何处老猿来觅得，又扶筇竹过桥西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46404,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入山杂咏二十首 其十九","author":"释函可","text":"閒踏荒莱见断碑，依稀篆迹似唐时。\n此中或是唐朝寺，问著山人总不知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46405,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入山杂咏二十首 其二十","author":"释函可","text":"采将山菜山柴煮，更汲山泉彻底清。\n野老自言年八十，年年食此不知名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46406,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶成","author":"释函可","text":"不因贫病不思乡，愁绪弥天恨夕阳。\n自顾一身如此小，千峰犹恨莫能藏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46407,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠友人十二首 其一","author":"释函可","text":"愁生白日恨馀晖，夜夜披霜舞綵衣。\n莫道梦归全不当，一年一半近庭闱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46408,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠友人十二首 其二","author":"释函可","text":"长读金刚一卷经，经声才罢暗叮咛。\n生还菽水无他愿，双白看儿到百龄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46409,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠友人十二首 其三","author":"释函可","text":"两世持衡淡有馀，传家只有一楼书。\n年来方识全无用，那得神仙到白鱼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46410,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠友人十二首 其四","author":"释函可","text":"伯夷大笑入重泉，先代弓裘颈血溅。\n自是吹篪相和切，又看一雁度寒边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46411,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠友人十二首 其五","author":"释函可","text":"岁岁空看塞雁归，何曾一见寄来衣。\n遥知香阁无穷泪，出到堂前不敢挥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46412,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠友人十二首 其六","author":"释函可","text":"寥寥几字寄空笺，道是平安泪亦涟。\n常恐未能痴且鲁，偷将纸笔续残篇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46413,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠友人十二首 其七","author":"释函可","text":"一杯浊酒柰愁何，尽日看天自放歌。\n衣上密缝还是旧，泪残风裂已无多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46414,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠友人十二首 其八","author":"释函可","text":"含泪题诗不敢悲，春风应见雁参差。\n山河异昔休轻问，梦里曾经汝自知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46415,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠友人十二首 其九","author":"释函可","text":"独有声音不改初，想当细认泪盈裾。\n呼儿开阁尘应满，简点当年旧著书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46416,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠友人十二首 其十","author":"释函可","text":"几年灯火伴僧孤，香烬衾寒水一壶。\n他日鹿门山上梦，又应夜夜到边隅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46417,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠友人十二首 其十一","author":"释函可","text":"华表还将老鹤羁，先分一羽莫迟迟。\n何时把臂山阴道，赠我前朝竹一枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46418,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠友人十二首 其十二","author":"释函可","text":"相知惟我泪难乾，三嘱殷勤晓露寒。\n便是羊裘容易识，十分珍重钓鱼竿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46419,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日左公招郭北登高","author":"释函可","text":"篱边不见菊花开，门外时闻慧远来。\n万里风沙愁黯黯，相携莫上望乡台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46420,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠海城王令公五首 其一","author":"释函可","text":"三年前此飘花雨，今日来看一县花。\n旧户新氓俱乞遍，一瓢直入到公家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46421,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠海城王令公五首 其二","author":"释函可","text":"衙斋如水小窗虚，一局残棋一卷书。\n未见便知非俗吏，祇疑丁令旧仙居。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46422,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠海城王令公五首 其三","author":"释函可","text":"天明野外劝农回，又向城头辟旧莱。\n才欲关门看宋拓，忽闻吏报老僧来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46423,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠海城王令公五首 其四","author":"释函可","text":"不嫌粗粝分僧钵，竹院过寻日日閒。\n更欲论诗情未慊，几回骑马入深山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46424,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠海城王令公五首 其五","author":"释函可","text":"鸣琴关镇晓风清，携得弦歌遍海城。\n父老岂长看昼锦，中原最苦是苍生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46425,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陈令公重招不往","author":"释函可","text":"重招野老了残棋，竹杖将行又故迟。\n不是韬光莺燕怯，署寒如水病难支。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46426,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重入山寄木公二首 其一","author":"释函可","text":"千丈秋岩锦十层，去年著屐忆同登。\n只兹一点清閒事，除却先生便不能。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46427,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重入山寄木公二首 其二","author":"释函可","text":"尘世青山隔几何，高人只可一来过。\n不知老衲修何福，随意烟岚日夜多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46428,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"至日雪","author":"释函可","text":"见说阳回何处觅，山山惟有雪风狂。\n几多束手茆檐下，又见愁添一线长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46429,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄寿大公","author":"释函可","text":"山塞惟予在汝先，年年酌水献诗篇。\n天心只爱文章老，那管长愁几百年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46430,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"龙牙寄大公","author":"释函可","text":"山中何事苦相思，共是寒风君最饥。\n钵底分将山味苦，几年尝尽自应知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46431,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山药寄木公","author":"释函可","text":"淡中滋味少人知，带雪锄来寄所思。\n为语邺侯须领取，懒残斫额已多时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46432,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大翁携来诸物俱典尽各赋一绝 其一 琴","author":"释函可","text":"一曲拘幽心已悲，高山流水尚相随。\n年来弦断桐俱爨，十指空留向子期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46433,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大翁携来诸物俱典尽各赋一绝 其二 画","author":"释函可","text":"一幅长悬万壑秋，草堂閒卧共僧游。\n巨源一去云山尽，雪满泥倾破壁留。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46434,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大翁携来诸物俱典尽各赋一绝 其三 砚","author":"释函可","text":"一片寒岩袖不离，云霞隐隐旧家遗。\n马肝食尽愁鸲鹆，拾得残砖写旧诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46435,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大翁携来诸物俱典尽各赋一绝 其四 法帖","author":"释函可","text":"谩传欈李千金值，燕市相逢识者希。\n今日风流无晋代，更搜残墨换鹅归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46436,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄答曰庐诸子","author":"释函可","text":"书来知汝未曾离，竹杖麻鞋好护持。\n我罪已深衰更甚，不须翘足看松枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46437,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄丽和尚","author":"释函可","text":"人天翘首岭云空，又向匡庐觅旧丛。\n杖底瀑飞三百丈，好携一滴洒辽东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46438,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答浪杖人","author":"释函可","text":"怜儿不觉鬓毛残，几度音来泪未乾。\n怀里有香头有雪，灯花应照海波寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46439,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢江南诸友寄笔墨","author":"释函可","text":"肯怯层冰骨已残，独愁破砚泪难乾。\n凭君寄我如椽管，写尽天山百丈寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46440,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"笑峰兄受杖人付嘱以书来并寄诸刻","author":"释函可","text":"石头风雨共朝昏，万里音书度玉门。\n云月是同溪不别，更惊一吼海澜翻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46441,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冯兄来言龙公入城同木公心公寓时心公得子口占","author":"释函可","text":"客言星聚塞烟微，青琐花砖共土围。\n夜半呱呱惊梦醒，却疑白板旧黄扉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46442,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"心公移寓木公舍得子二首 其一","author":"释函可","text":"旧宫深锁土墙低，书卷荒凉俎豆泥。\n见说北郊夫子在，三迁直向雪边栖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46443,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"心公移寓木公舍得子二首 其二","author":"释函可","text":"相依庑下朔风吹，更截牛衣为裹儿。\n想得高堂寒夜梦，拨开深雪自含饴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46444,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"木公书来极言乾公近状同难蒙福志喜","author":"释函可","text":"白昼轻裘度玉门，须眉耿耿暗声吞。\n此行不为乡情重，携取春风散五原。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46445,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"贺孝公被挞二首 其一","author":"释函可","text":"狱吏何妨溺死灰，独将鸡肋抵轰雷。\n翻嫌昔日王孙饿，宁受尊拳不受哀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46446,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"贺孝公被挞二首 其二","author":"释函可","text":"何人雪底缚袁安，不用攒眉且自看。\n总为梅花消息近，又添彻骨一番寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46447,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冯公冒雪入山同卧","author":"释函可","text":"不负崎岖路几千，歌声哭语雪中眠。\n自言到此今经岁，一夕真当胜十年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46448,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"生日碧师见访","author":"释函可","text":"萧萧匹马扣山扉，不用开言我自知。\n空见雨花堆满迹，一瓢寒雪共支饥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46449,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠梁公","author":"释函可","text":"曾向苍梧恐百蛮，十年彳亍鬓毛删。\n独支破灶炊残雪，双袖还留帝女斑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46450,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"呈骡","author":"释函可","text":"怜我长将病骨驼，难随冀足度关河。\n生刍一束兼孤钵，累子人呼乞食骡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46451,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"写诗寄同难","author":"释函可","text":"见说残冬望我来，老僧一见笑颜开。\n寄君一卷新诗句，每到愁来读一回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46452,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"看花","author":"释函可","text":"春色蒙头过去休，偶随山鹿树边留。\n年年花发无心看，不似今年花更愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46453,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"燕衔花","author":"释函可","text":"今年寒甚去年寒，春雪才乾花事阑。\n燕子似怜人不见，故衔一片到蒲团。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46454,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"落花十首 其一","author":"释函可","text":"片片何因再上枝，可怜摇落始应知。\n老夫无限伤心泪，只在东风第一吹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46455,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"落花十首 其二","author":"释函可","text":"莫向枝头顷刻论，春光一等付郊园。\n纷纷开落无穷恨，只有青松自感恩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46456,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"落花十首 其三","author":"释函可","text":"倚仗秾华最可怜，牡丹画就亦徒然。\n燕支山有倾颓日，未必红颜保百年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46457,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"落花十首 其四","author":"释函可","text":"未曾衰谢断人肠，拗折何因委道旁。\n却忆人时情漫切，镜台从此恨眉长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46458,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"落花十首 其五","author":"释函可","text":"何须洒泪向空枝，狼藉苍苔苦不辞。\n细想芳园繁茂日，由来不是别风吹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46459,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"落花十首 其六","author":"释函可","text":"桃李春深自不言，肯教他树更承恩。\n于今金谷多荒棘，不及梅花别有村。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46460,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"落花十首 其七","author":"释函可","text":"琥珀才倾日已西，夜来风雨暗凄凄。\n曾将歌舞承欢宴，敢惜春泥践马蹄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46461,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"落花十首 其八","author":"释函可","text":"乱点欹崖自不平，一番雨过一番情。\n谁能把得春光住，莫怨楼头羌笛声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":46462,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]